What's the difference between using {e'i} and using {ko}? When would you
use {e'i} without {ko}, and vice versa?

stevo (aka la stevon)


On Mon, Apr 29, 2013 at 1:14 PM, .arpis. <rpglover64+jbobau@gmail.com>wrote:

> Reading the BPFK definition of {e'i} here<http://www.lojban.org/tiki/BPFK+Section%3A+Irrealis+Attitudinals>,
